2 ┆ -0.61 │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ 0.010 ┆ 0.07 ┆ 0.01 ┆ 0.013 ┆ ... ┆ -60.77 ┆ -602.97 ┆ -5.38 ┆ -0.58 │\r\n└───────┴──────┴──────┴───────┴─────┴────────┴─────────┴───────┴───────┘\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n\r\n```\r\n┌──────┬──────┬──────┬───────┬─────┬────────┬─────────┬───────┬───────┐\r\n│ ET   ┆ V    ┆ N    ┆ SA    ┆ ... ┆ FY     ┆ FZ      ┆ MX    ┆ MZ    │\r\n│ ---  ┆ ---  ┆ ---  ┆ ---   ┆     ┆ ---    ┆ ---     ┆ ---   ┆ ---   │\r\n│ f64  ┆ f64  ┆ f64  ┆ f64   ┆     ┆ f64    ┆ f64     ┆ f64   ┆ f64   │\r\n╞══════╪══════╪══════╪═══════╪═════╪════════╪═════════╪═══════╪═══════╡\r\n│ 0.0  ┆ 0.05 ┆ 0.08 ┆ 0.007 ┆ ... ┆ -59.6  ┆ -605.62 ┆ -4.02 ┆ -0.61 │\r\n├╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┼╌╌╌╌╌╌╌┤\r\n│ 0.01 ┆ 0.07 ┆ 0.01 ┆ 0.013 ┆ ... ┆ -60.77 ┆ -602.97 ┆ -5.38 ┆ -0.58 │\r\n└──────┴──────┴──────┴───────┴─────┴────────┴─────────┴───────┴───────┘\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Installed Versions\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n[dependencies]\r\npolars = { git = \"https://github.com/pola-rs/polars\"}\r\n</details>\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"TheEppicJR","id":19803478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODAzNDc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19803478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR","html_url":"https://github.com/TheEppicJR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEppicJR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheEpp